-0 on closed changes","A maintainer reverts the noop thinking it violates the documented gate contract"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add a one-line amendment to ADR 0023 describing the closed-change terminal noop disposition, and reference it from the plan.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.4286,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Record in the plan why the final cast reimplements the SSH `gerrit review` call in a repo helper rather than a lighter-touch alternative (continue-on-error wrapping of gerrit-review-action plus a closed-change post-probe, or upstreaming closed-change tolerance), given ADR 0023 designates that action as the standard inbound-vote path.","cohort":["T1"],"criteria":["T1"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.7246,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["ADR 0023 designates the action as the standard inbound path: 'the production g2p pattern (ONAP/O-RAN-SC) uses SSH via lfreleng-actions/gerrit-review-action' and 'the inbound vote path is the price of reusing the production g2p bridge instead of a bespoke callback'","Web search (releng LF docs) confirms gerrit-review-action's vote-type domain {clear,success,failure,cancelled} and no closed-change tolerance — consistent with the plan's premise, but the plan does not state why reimplementing the SSH call beats wrapping the endorsed action","The plan DOES mirror the existing in-repo raw-SSH comment step (gerrit-verify.yaml lines 574-610), so the pattern itself is established prior art — the gap is purely the missing rationale for diverging from the ADR-named action"],"finding":"The plan replaces the ADR-0023-endorsed gerrit-review-action for the final Verified cast with a bespoke SSH helper but does not weigh alternatives to reimplementation (e.g. keeping the action and tolerating its closed-change failure at the workflow layer via continue-on-error plus a closed-change post-probe, or upstreaming closed-change tolerance to the action).","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f24d2deeccbe5d80c","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan section 'Plan' (\"Replace only the final `Cast Verified from the CI conclusion` step's opaque `gerrit-review-action` invocation with a trusted repo helper\")","norm_id":"n24f3db7968d06c2f","priority":0.0754,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A future maintainer asks why two of the three Gerrit vote interactions (clear-vote, and previously cast) use the action while the cast now uses a hand-rolled SSH helper, and finds no recorded justification","The action later gains native closed-change tolerance, making the bespoke helper redundant maintenance the plan never anticipated"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2857,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing